            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se il numero a sinistra è minore del numero a destra, come in <code>1 &lt; 235</code>, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>1</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>235</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se il numero a sinistra è minore di quello a destra, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><p>Usa l'operatore minore di affinché il codice visualizzi <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"42\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>42</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>235</code>.</p></body></html>",
