            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero è minore o uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore minore o uguale</strong>, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
