            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se <code>solved</code> è minore o uguale a <code>minimum</code>, poi registra il risultato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" solved = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minimum = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lostStreak = solved &lt;= minimum;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lostStreak);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>solved</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>minimum</code>.</p></body></html>"
